measurements and must not be compared directly to body circumference.') on conflict (id) do update set measurement_basis = excluded.measurement_basis, basis_evidence = excluded.basis_evidence, unit = excluded.unit, size_system = excluded.size_system, retrieved_on = excluded.retrieved_on, fit_advice = excluded.fit_advice, notes = excluded.notes;
